I haven't added the two operations requests. This node's world imports only `state-read`, and a WASI-less `wasm32-unknown-unknown` component has no filesystem access, so the log write can't work. The enrichment fetch would need an `http-client` capability this node doesn't declare, and it would send untrusted feed text to an external URL. Adding either would widen the node's authority beyond its declared type. If operations needs them, that should go through the graph's capability declarations, not a change to this node.

